      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If this is the end we face, then let us dictate the terms of that dying breath. True knightly resolve isn't just about surviving; it's about how you meet your fate when all else is lost. While the darkness calls you to surrender to the blade, I say the final act of defiance to this dishonor is to choose *how* you fall—not just when. Let us carve a legend from this final moment, brave friend.",
